    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Reply triage\nMatches the incoming email to a lead by Gmail Thread ID (no match = stop). One Claude Haiku call summarises the reply, checks for a removal request and classifies it (Hot / Warm / Cold / Not interested / Auto-reply); a Switch routes on the category. If the first Anthropic account errors (credits exhausted, rate limit), the chain retries on the account-2 model. Writes Stage / Reply Category / Reply Summary, logs the reply in HubSpot and alerts Nil on Hot replies. Auto-replies change nothing. Each classified reply is appended to the Log tab.",
        "height": 180,
        "width": 400
      },
      "id": "ffb3c9fe-0428-4d0c-a85f-841b8a0ced9d",
      "name": "Note: Reply triage",
